Theorem OUTER_MBASIS_REFL : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall i :e omega, outer A (mbasis A {i}) (mbasis A {i}) = vec (multivector A) 0.
Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/clifford.ml:723 / OUTER_MBASIS_LSCALAR
